WEBVTT

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:30.856
They were everywhere, and my mother
would turn the kitchen into a darkroom.

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:33.016
And there weren't
just pictures that she took

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:34.576
and pictures of family members.

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:39.176
But there were pictures on the wall
of and by people that we didn't know,

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:41.216
men and women that we didn't know.

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:42.456
Thanks, ma.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:43.696
(Laughter)

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:44.936
I have my own timing.

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:46.616
(Laughter)

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:47.856
Did you see her poke me?

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.096
(Laughter)

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:50.320
Puppet strings.

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.296
I grew up in a house full of photographs.

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:59.536
(Applause)

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:02.456
But they weren't just pictures
of men and women that we knew,